        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"69179d01-e32f-44d4-bddc-254ee23bfc7e\",\"review_text\":\"they should add listen to offline music for free\"},{\"review_id\":\"b99f086c-ce4b-4084-b6bb-2bf1a26765aa\",\"review_text\":\"Worst update... everyone better use any other music apps\"},{\"review_id\":\"75f36548-7b8b-4197-b8b9-bf5e323f2522\",\"review_text\":\"I just want one song to wake up to\"},{\"review_id\":\"d732c58c-cdc2-40d9-89f9-fcc2f2eb2225\",\"review_text\":\"As a premium member it's the best investment for me. It's amazing to listen to what I want when I want.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8938fa2a-113b-4a71-b59c-3529feaf13ba\",\"review_text\":\"kenapa setiap mau pembelian premium selalu gagal? padahal koneksi internet baik?\"},{\"review_id\":\"c8f27ddd-c87e-414c-b091-4aab97ff46d1\",\"review_text\":\"I've unfollowed the artist/podcast a long time ago, still getting push notifications for their release. Tried everything but didn't find anyway.\"},{\"review_id\":\"3efc6351-d532-4670-9957-b99ed363ce0a\",\"review_text\":\"ON\"},{\"review_id\":\"736de827-aae8-4cc0-8b18-cd04ab3ed489\",\"review_text\":\"Previously it was good but now they have removed songs which come under Zee Music Label. Hope they'll resolve soon.\"},{\"review_id\":\"0df49fb8-99bc-41c4-a8bd-5cd3ee88970b\",\"review_text\":\"I like the song recommendations. But the unskippable ads, especially the Daza sisters' podcast is just so annoying bruh.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f8fafe2c-c60e-42dc-9cee-13f4ce9ea00e\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent 👍\"}]}"
